<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-G MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-G MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.39 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.55 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.38 vs   0.70</p>
<p> Sales		   11.51 vs   3.69</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.42 vs   0.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.99 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Sales		   23.54 vs   8.24</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
